5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I am Minato. I hope we can have a peaceful game.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Greetings. I am Benjamin. Let us proceed with logic and calm.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Welcome, young ones. Wisdom comes from listening to the wind.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi there! I'm May. Let's make this fun, shall we?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey. I'm Takumi. I won't back down from anyone.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"I like the sound of that, May. Let's be friends.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Cooperation is key. I will observe carefully.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. The old man sees much in silence.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"Benjamin, you seem very serious. Are you hiding something?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm just watching. No one is safe from my eyes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I don't think anyone is hiding. We are all here.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,Perhaps. But suspicion is a natural part of this game.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,Suspicion can be a blade. Use it wisely.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,I like Servas's advice. It sounds very wise.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I don't need advice. I know what I'm doing.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,Okay. I will try to be careful.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,Good. Let us end the day with clear minds.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,The night is coming. May it be gentle.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"Goodnight, everyone. See you in the morning.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Night. Don't die.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
