31,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. I feel refreshed. Who is suspicious?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I have information. Minato, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Oh my. A bold accusation, Benjamin.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"Wait, really? Minato is the wolf? That's shocking.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Huh? Minato? I didn't think so.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,That's a lie! I am a villager. Benjamin is lying.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I am the Seer. I checked you last night. You are the wolf.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Benjamin, if you are the Seer, why trust you?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,I believe Benjamin. He seems calm and confident.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't know. But if Benjamin is right, we should vote Minato.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,You are all gullible. Benjamin is just guessing.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Guessing? I have proof. My role is verified by the game.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"The old man believes in truth. Benjamin, speak clearly.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm with Benjamin. Minato, you're acting too defensive.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"Okay, I'm voting Minato. Let's get this over with.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,Fine. I accept my fate. But I will haunt you.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,You will not haunt anyone. You will be executed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,A tragic end. But necessary for the village.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,Good riddance. Let's protect the rest of us.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Yeah. Let's do it.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
